          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Add letterbox or pillarbox framing with preset aspect ratios, then reframe the image inside the visible area."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101400340",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x100090698",
            "function": "sub_10009053c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Chooses a framing preset from the horizontal aspect ratio strip. Use Off to disable the effect or Custom to dial an exact ratio."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101401340",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10008e61c",
            "function": "sub_10008e52c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Applies Filmic Split presets, including stylized negative, print, monochrome, slide, instant, chrome, and city-inspired looks."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x1014013c0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10008e688",
            "function": "sub_10008e52c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Blends between the original image and the selected split-tone preset."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101401410",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10008e6b4",
            "function": "sub_10008e52c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Controls film-style saturation before the preset is applied. Values below 100% desaturate, while values above 100% add saturation."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x1014014a0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10008e6e0",
            "function": "sub_10008e52c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Pushes or pulls the log image around the preset stage."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101404550",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x100087c0c",
            "function": "sub_100087b1c"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Tells PeekLUT what your footage was shot in and what it should look like on screen. Most users can leave this on Off. It's only needed when shooting in a flat \"log\" profile such as Apple Log, ARRI LogC, Sony S-Log3, Fuji F-Log, or RED Log3G10. Pick the matching preset to convert log footage back to a normal-looking image, or use the Input and Output tabs to set things manually."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101405530",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x100174154",
            "function": "sub_100173f08"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Draw Mask assets do not match the preset (missing: ["
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101405fd0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x1001eccb4",
            "function": "sub_1001ecc44"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Failed to create export session with preset: "
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101407d80",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028acd8",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Tone Mapping**: Color Space Transform now rolls highlights off smoothly instead of clipping them. It turns on automatically for log footage, and you can pin it on or off per clip.\n• **Improved Highlights and Shadows**: Rebuilt for cleaner, more natural results. Saved presets and projects may look slightly different, so you can switch back to Legacy Highlights/Shadows from the editor's Preview menu."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101408850",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b0b0",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Color Space Transform**: Pick a camera preset for Apple Log, ARRI LogC, Sony S-Log3, Fuji F-Log, or RED Log3G10 to convert log footage back to a normal-looking image.\n• **CRT Emulation**: Recreate a CRT TV look with screen curvature, RGB fringing, scanlines, and 480i-style interlace flicker."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101408980",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b154",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Filmic Split**: Fourteen hand-tuned split-tone presets including Velvet Negative, Cinema Stock, Amber Print, and Tokyo Print, with film saturation and push and pull controls.\n• **Color Luminance**: Brighten or darken red, green, blue, cyan, magenta, and yellow independently to lift skies, deepen reds, or recover skin tones."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x1014090f0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b488",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Rendering update**: PeekLUT now uses Render Engine V2 for everyone to keep editing and presets consistent.\n• **Auto Crop**: Added one-tap smart crop from the Crop menu for faster framing.\n• **Tetra Color Mix filter**: Fine-tune how red, green, blue, and mixed colors blend for cleaner color separation.\n• **LUT Folder Sync**: Import LUT folders, sync linked sources, and review added/removed LUTs before applying changes.\n• **Histogram in compact editor**: New compact histogram with Hue/RGB modes and quick show/hide toggle."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x1014093c0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b5d4",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **New compact layout for editing**. Will replace current editor soon. Feedback welcome.\n• Saturate: boosts or reduces color intensity per channel: negative desaturates, positive saturates.\n• Option to stack LUTs on or off\n• LUT intensity now stays the same when saving and loading presets"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x1014097f0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b7c8",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "  • **ProRes export support**: Now you can export your videos in Apple ProRes 422 and ProRes 4444 for higher fidelity. (Requires .mov container)\n  • **Custom Bit rate support**: Take control of your video quality by setting a custom bit rate (Mbps) or choosing from our optimized presets (Low, Medium, High, Maximum).\n  • Bug fixes and improvements"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101409e70",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028bc54",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **New Rendering engine**: Improved to preserve image, avoid banding, more accurate adjustments. Old rendering engine is still temporary available but please update your presets when you can\n• **Major improvements** to Color Grading, adjustable Grain. (Overlays still available in Textures)\n• **New Filters**: Fade, Clarity, Sharpness, Whites, Blacks (Available in new Render Engine only)\n• **Easier way** to navigate LUT Folders"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a030",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028bcf8",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• New Presets: **Deep Cine, Warma, Jackson Ave**  \n• New Filter: **Blackpoint and Bloom (Experimental)**  \n• Last layout position is now saved and restored when opening the app\n• New simple / advanced options for exporting\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a180",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028be40",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• Halation can now be saved to presets 🎉\n• Color grading blending now starts at 50%...(just a lot better..trust me)"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a200",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028bee8",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• Support for LUT_3D_SIZE 65 and 64. Minor improments underhood to LUT loading\n• Fullscreen support for photos and video\n• Fix a bug that would cause exporting videos shot on iPhone with spatial audio support to fail\n• Moved presets to its own button in the tab"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a3a0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028c038",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Halation Filter**: Add halation to images and video, works best on night photos.\n🚨 Experimental feature, saving to preset disabled for now.\n• Fixes to orientation when exporting an image\n• Fixes Before and After slider, now clips to image size\n• Please reach out via email if there are any features you'd like to see 🤓"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a7a0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028c368",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• Added **presets**: Save your and reuse your current editing settings\n• Built in **presets** for easier cinematic looks\n• **HDR** support for videos"
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140ad60",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x1002b4354",
            "function": "sub_1002b4208"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "Turning on these toggles deletes the local LUT copy. Presets using deleted LUTs may break."
      },
